<h1>About BuildJury</h1>
<p><strong>BuildJury (buildjury.com) is an independent guide that ranks AI build tools by what you are building, and its rankings are never for sale.</strong></p>
<h2>Who runs it</h2>
<p>BuildJury is edited by {EDITOR}. [EDITOR BIO: 2 to 3 sentences on background and why they review these tools.]</p>
<h2>Why it's independent</h2>
<ul><li>No vendor can buy a rank, a verdict or a review.</li><li>Sponsored placements are always labeled "Sponsored" and sit outside ranked lists.</li><li>Every fact links to an official source. Prices appear only when confirmed on the official pricing page.</li></ul>
<p>Read the full <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>. Formerly called BuildStack.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p class="mono">{CONTACT}</p>
